ows 2 items with title, photo, location (Brooklyn, NY / Austin, TX) and price; total $320.00 = 285+35.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-9\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"On prod-1 (Emma's, available, not owned by Tess): Send button disabled while message empty; after typing a message, sending closed the dialog and showed toast \\\"Message sent to seller!\\\".\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-21\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Category chosen on the Categories page is not applied to browse results\", \"actual\": \"Categories page listed Home Decor \\\"2 items\\\"; clicking it navigated to /?category=home-decor but the browse grid showed all 10 listings (prod-1..prod-10 across every category) with count \\\"10 items available\\\", and every category checkbox in the filter sidebar remained unchecked — the category query parameter is ignored.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-22\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Sellers have no way to view purchase requests or buyer messages; the cart \\\"requests sent\\\" confirmation is unverifiable\", \"actual\": \"Bob Buyer sent a message on prod-1 (\\\"QA-TEST-MESSAGE: ...\\\") and a cart purchase request for prod-1 (Emma Green) + prod-9 (Sofia Martinez), each confirmed by toast. Signing in as Emma Green: My Listings shows only her two listings with View/Mark Sold/Delete and no request/message area; her own product page shows only \\\"Manage Your Listings\\\" and no buyer message (page text does not contain the message); \\\"My Profile\\\" leads to a 404 page, and /requests, /messages, /inbox are all 404. The cart reported \\\"Purchase requests sent to sellers!\\\" although no request is retrievable anywhere.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-10\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Login with nobody@nowhere.test rejected: \\\"Invalid credentials. Try: emma@example.com\\\", stayed on /login, no session created.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Registering \\\"EMMA@Example.com\\\" and \\\"Emma@EXAMPLE.com\\\" (case-only variations of emma@example.com) both showed \\\"An account with this email already exists\\\", stayed on /register with no session created. Afterwards emma@example.com still logs in as the original \\\"Emma Green\\\" (Brooklyn, NY) with her original listings (Mid-Century Modern Armchair, Handmade Macrame Wall Hanging) — account not replaced.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-12\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Password is not verified — any password authenticates a registered account\", \"actual\": \"Signing in as emma@example.com with the password \\\"definitely-not-her-password\\\" succeeded: toast \\\"Welcome back!\\\", redirect to /, header user menu present (authenticated session). The login page itself states \\\"Demo accounts: ... (any password works)\\\".\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Signed in as Tess viewing Emma's prod-1: only \\\"Add to Cart\\\" and \\\"Message Seller\\\" — no Mark Sold/Delete/Manage controls. On Tess's own listing the same page showed \\\"Manage Your Listings\\\" and My Listings exposed Mark Sold/Delete only for her own item (My Listings listed only her listing).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Empty submit blocked by native required validation (\\\"Please fill out this field.\\\" on title/description/price); missing category/condition → toast \\\"Please fill in all required fields\\\"; all fields set but no photo → toast \\\"Please add at least one image\\\"; no listing created in any case.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Price field is input[type=number][min=0][step=0.01][required]; entering -5 and submitting blocked creation (stayed on /create-listing, validity.valid=false); non-numeric text cannot be entered into the field at all.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-23\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Gated pages render a blank screen instead of a sign-in prompt or redirect; header cart button is a silent no-op when signed out\", \"actual\": \"Signed out: /create-listing and /cart render an empty page (body text length 0, no prompt, no redirect, URL unchanged after 1.5s); clicking the header cart icon on / did nothing (stayed on /, no prompt). Correct behaviour only for the product page: \\\"Add to Cart\\\" redirected to /login and the message dialog showed a disabled \\\"Log in to message\\\" button.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Submitting EMMA@Example.com showed immediate error \\\"An account with this email already exists\\\"; form stayed on /register with all entered values retained and editable.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Typing \\\"DENIM\\\" character-by-character (pressSequentially) updated results to 1 item and count to \\\"1 items available\\\" with no submit/Enter; clearing the field instantly restored \\\"10 items available\\\".\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Each change applied instantly with no submit: Furniture → 3 items, +New → 2 items, min price 250 → \\\"1 items available\\\"; distance 1 mi → \\\"0 items available / No items found\\\"; upcycled toggle → 5 items; sort select re-ordered the grid immediately. \\\"Clear all filters\\\" restored 10 items available, $0-$500 and distance Any.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-19\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clicking Add to Cart showed toast \\\"Added to cart!\\\" immediately and header cart badge went 0→1→2 with no reload; cart page line items and $320.00 total reflected the additions.\"}, {\